.TH "DNF5DAEMON-SERVER" "8" "Sep 06, 2026" "" "dnf5"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dnf5daemon-server \- Package management service with a DBus interface
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBsystemctl start dnf5daemon\-server\fP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
dnf5daemon\-server is D\-Bus interface for libdnf5 package manager.
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \fBdnf5daemon\-server configuration\fP
/etc/dnf/dnf5daemon\-server.conf
.sp
Use the \fB[main]\fP section to override any main DNF5 configuration option. See \fBdnf5.conf(5)\fP, Main configuration options \%<#\:conf-main-options-label>\&.
.UNINDENT
